{"title":"Hill Giant Behemoth","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 25 Hill Giant that attacks with crush (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">burn</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">freeze</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">shock</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">crush</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">slash</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      \n      \n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/giants-knucklebone\">Giants Knucklebone</a> <span class=\"muted\">(infuses an enchant)</span>. A small chance on any kill, far better from elites. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Reforging</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/hill-giant-behemoth\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/hill-giant-behemoth?lv=25\">Lv 25 <span>22</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/hill-giant-behemoth?lv=27\">Lv 27 <span>2</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/hill-giant-behemoth\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>25</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>89</td><td>18.3</td><td>1,250</td><td class=\"muted\">267 · 25.6 · 3,750</td><td>22</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Antlion%20Hive\">Antlion Hive</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/hill-giant-behemoth?lv=27\" title=\"Pick level 27\"><td><b>27</b></td><td>100</td><td>19.4</td><td>1,350</td><td class=\"muted\">300 · 27.2 · 4,050</td><td>2</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Behemoth's%20Wallow\">Behemoth&#39;s Wallow</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"hill-giant-behemoth\" data-map-level=\"25\">Show level 25 on the map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 4 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - in 0% of 4 looted corpses, 16 recorded drops, 899 total, 20–170 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">0% · 0/4</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"silver-battlespear\" title=\"Silver Battlespear - in 50% of 4 looted corpses, 2 recorded drops, 2 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/cd1fb2526f13180d08b3.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Silver Battlespear</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">50% · 2/4</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Shoddy: 1 of 2</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"pendant-emerald\" title=\"Pendant Emerald - in 25% of 4 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/d15206290a8ce5b68154.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Pendant Emerald</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">25% · 1/4</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"health-potion-medium\" title=\"Health Potion Medium - in 25% of 4 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/6003f0952eddf298b4c8.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Health Potion Medium</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">25% · 1/4</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Percentages are of the corpses whose loot the collector recorded, so kills you did not loot are not counted.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><figure class=\"wp-inset\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"wp-inset-map\" style=\"transform:translate(-150.5px,-714.7px)\"><img src=\"tiles/3/0/2.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:0px;top:512px\"><img src=\"tiles/3/0/3.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:0px;top:768px\"><img src=\"tiles/3/1/2.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:256px;top:512px\"><img src=\"tiles/3/1/3.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:256px;top:768px\"><i style=\"left:165.2px;top:709.1px\"></i><i style=\"left:173.3px;top:708.7px\"></i><i style=\"left:130.7px;top:714.5px\"></i><i style=\"left:94.3px;top:770.2px\"></i><i style=\"left:142.2px;top:717.5px\"></i><i style=\"left:145.6px;top:713.8px\"></i><i style=\"left:122.4px;top:775.2px\"></i><i style=\"left:157.7px;top:715.8px\"></i><i style=\"left:140.2px;top:740.5px\"></i><i style=\"left:137.4px;top:719.2px\"></i><i style=\"left:85.1px;top:760.0px\"></i></div><figcaption>Antlion Hive</figcaption></figure><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Antlion%20Hive\">Antlion Hive</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 12 spots</span></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Behemoth's%20Wallow\">Behemoth&#39;s Wallow</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 3 spots</span></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"hill-giant-behemoth\">Show on map</button>\n      <h2>Named ones <span class=\"muted\" style=\"font-size:14px\">(1)</span></h2><div class=\"named-grid\"><a class=\"named-card\" href=\"#/npc/gristlejaw\"><img src=\"data/img/ccdf417fc3d69d1ad283.webp\" alt=\"\"><b>Gristlejaw</b><span>Lv 27</span></a></div>\n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Hill Giant: <a href=\"#/monster/hill-giant-youth\">Hill Giant Youth</a> <span class=\"muted\">(13)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/hill-giant-adolescent\">Hill Giant Adolescent</a> <span class=\"muted\">(15)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/hill-giant-titan\">Hill Giant Titan</a> <span class=\"muted\">(18)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/hill-giant-brute\">Hill Giant Brute</a> <span class=\"muted\">(28)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/hill-giant-king\">Hill Giant King</a> <span class=\"muted\">(30)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/9c1502dd610dfce57688.webp\" alt=\"Hill Giant Behemoth\"></div><h3>Hill Giant Behemoth</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td><b>25</b> <span class=\"muted\">(picked · base 25)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Hill Giant</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>crush · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>89</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>18.3</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>1,250</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>6.6 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>1.9</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>Yes (7 tiles)</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>No</td></tr><tr><th>Pendant / cape</th><td>Can drop</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Seen</th><td>24 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}